#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Stage 07: build the canonical 24-month Lichess kindness analysis panel.

This script joins three frozen, independently certified one-row-per-game layers:

  * Stage 05: behavioral opportunity, role, outcome, clock, and material authority;
  * Stage 06: Glicko-2 hidden-state and rating-cost authority;
  * Stockfish 18 / 100k: board-evaluation and fairness authority.

The script is deliberately fail-closed.  It defaults to PLAN mode.  Production
requires --execute.  Work is month-by-month, restartable, atomic at the monthly
file boundary, and non-destructive: an inconsistent existing month is never
overwritten.

Canonical main sample: 2023-11 through 2025-10 (24 months).

Suggested workflow
------------------

1. Plan only (seconds):

   python -u code/07_build_analysis_panel.py

2. One-month pilot into a separate root (roughly 5-20 minutes):

   python -u code/07_build_analysis_panel.py --execute --months 2023-11 \
       --output-root /Volumes/XT_Pro/lichess_kindness/derived/replication/analysis_panel_24m_sf100k_PILOT_2023-11

3. After pilot certification, run all months into the canonical root.  Resume
   is automatic for monthly products generated by this exact script and input
   authority.

The paper-facing favorable/non-loss convention is draw payoff >= 0.  The script
also preserves a strict-positive diagnostic without changing Stage 06's frozen
favorable_draw_v2 field.
"""

